From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: CroaBeast <66433837+CroaBeast@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 00:47:52 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] feat(conversation): smaller, grouped and collapsible activity
 events
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Kuraka-Severity: required
Kuraka-Missing-En: Activity events are large and each takes its own row, so long runs of them bury the messages.
Kuraka-Missing-Es: Los eventos de actividad son grandes y cada uno ocupa su propia fila, así que las rachas largas tapan los mensajes.
Kuraka-Adds-En: Activity events are smaller, and several in a row are grouped and can be folded so they do not bury the messages.
Kuraka-Adds-Es: Los eventos de actividad son más pequeños, y varios seguidos se agrupan y se pueden plegar para que no tapen los mensajes.
---
